- ⚠️ Functional mismatch risk: UI grants KPI admins access to submit impact data, but backend POST `/api/kpi/impact-data` requires `isWorkerAuthenticated` + `isWorkerAdmin` (worker auth system). KPI login is separate (client-side session), so “Save” can fail with 401/403 for KPI admins unless they also hold an active worker-admin session.
